    ('714675cd-437d-5913-9525-3fa46a38817a', '2263521e-5884-51bc-98b2-32ec90592bbc', $q$For  int[] a = new int[5];  which index is the LAST valid one?$q$, 'MCQ', $o$["a[5]", "a[4]", "a[6]", "a[-1]"]$o$, $a$a[4]$a$, $e$Indexes run from 0 to length - 1, so a 5-element array ends at a[4]. a[5] is the classic off-by-one and throws ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException.$e$, 10, 1, now(), now()),
