    ('799d086c-5555-51cc-a2bf-93fbc9d380a4', '2263521e-5884-51bc-98b2-32ec90592bbc', $q$You must double every element of an int array in place. Which traversal works?$q$, 'CHOOSE_APPROACH', $o$["Enhanced for loop assigning to the loop variable", "Enhanced for loop followed by a.length++", "Clone the array and double only the copy", "Indexed for loop assigning to a[i]"]$o$, $a$Indexed for loop assigning to a[i]$a$, $e$The enhanced for variable is only a copy of each element, so assigning to it never changes the array. Writing through the index changes the real element.$e$, 15, 4, now(), now()),
